in Chief of LinkedIn.

00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:12.707
A lot to talk about on
both the future of work

00:00:12.707 --> 00:00:14.287
and a lot on just the future of media too,

00:00:14.287 --> 00:00:16.747
I think, it will be a really
