00:00:48.207 --> 00:00:50.327
But when we saw that
our costs had gone up,

00:00:50.327 --> 00:00:51.517
a lot more folks were dependent

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:53.197
on Khan Academy and continued to be,

00:00:53.197 --> 00:00:54.717
a special thanks to Bank of America,

00:00:54.717 --> 00:00:56.977
Google.org, AT&amp;T, Fastly, and Novartis,

00:00:56.977 --> 00:01:00.137
and the many other funders and
supporters of Khan Academy,

00:01:00.137 --> 00:01:03.447
pre and during COVID, and
hopefully post-COVID as well.

00:01:03.447 --> 00:01:04.487
We need your help,

00:01:04.487 --> 00:01:05.427
we continue to need your help,

